    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">CIPHER ZERO is a minimalist logic game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You have two actions:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><table><tr><th><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></th></tr><tr><th><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></th><td><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332180/extras/b50ac8da77be71ccf717f3ccab605a06.poster.avif?t=1754056733\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332180/extras/b50ac8da77be71ccf717f3ccab605a06.webm?t=1754056733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332180/extras/b50ac8da77be71ccf717f3ccab605a06.mp4?t=1754056733\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></td><td><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332180/extras/8a743d1472d70b8ada2aaf52dc3af512.poster.avif?t=1754056733\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332180/extras/8a743d1472d70b8ada2aaf52dc3af512.webm?t=1754056733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332180/extras/8a743d1472d70b8ada2aaf52dc3af512.mp4?t=1754056733\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></td></tr><tr><th><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></th><td><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Toggle a tile on or off.</strong></p></td><td><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Check your solution.</strong></p></td></tr></table><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332180/extras/1f67f1c9a3f81224971452299012671a.webp?t=1754056733\" /></div> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Experiment with curious glyphs to infer their rules. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Delve into over 300 hand-crafted puzzles to solve at your own pace. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Explore several locations that evolve and grow with your understanding. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Vibe with an immersive, chill soundtrack that reacts to your actions and experiences in the game. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332180/extras/35ed2eef1971980c822e215b74621471.webp?t=1754056733\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332180/extras/buoy-multi2.gif?t=1754056733\" /></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">CIPHER ZERO is a minimalist logic game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You have two actions:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><table><tr><th><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></th></tr><tr><th><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></th><td><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332180/extras/b50ac8da77be71ccf717f3ccab605a06.poster.avif?t=1754056733\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332180/extras/b50ac8da77be71ccf717f3ccab605a06.webm?t=1754056733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332180/extras/b50ac8da77be71ccf717f3ccab605a06.mp4?t=1754056733\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></td><td><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332180/extras/8a743d1472d70b8ada2aaf52dc3af512.poster.avif?t=1754056733\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332180/extras/8a743d1472d70b8ada2aaf52dc3af512.webm?t=1754056733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332180/extras/8a743d1472d70b8ada2aaf52dc3af512.mp4?t=1754056733\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></td></tr><tr><th><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></th><td><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Toggle a tile on or off.</strong></p></td><td><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Check your solution.</strong></p></td></tr></table><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332180/extras/1f67f1c9a3f81224971452299012671a.webp?t=1754056733\" /></div> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Experiment with curious glyphs to infer their rules. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Delve into over 300 hand-crafted puzzles to solve at your own pace. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Explore several locations that evolve and grow with your understanding. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Vibe with an immersive, chill soundtrack that reacts to your actions and experiences in the game. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332180/extras/35ed2eef1971980c822e215b74621471.webp?t=1754056733\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332180/extras/buoy-multi2.gif?t=1754056733\" /></div></p>",
    "short_description": "A minimalist logic game. Can you solve for \ud835\udc99?",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Dutch, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Vietnamese, Japanese",
    "reviews": "\u201cI\u2019m so impressed with Cipher Zero, and how much extra work has gone into every tiny element of its presentation, let alone the brilliance of the puzzle design. It\u2019s so rewarding to figure out what a new symbol means, and then to solve ever more complex puzzles as it re-introduces old rules into the new.\u201d<br>Buried Treasure<br><br>\u201cCipher Zero feels more like a paper sudoku book you might pull out on a morning commute on a subway. And then put away. And pull out again.\u201d<br>Curate.Games<br><br>\u201cCIPHER ZERO is a new \u201crule discovery\u201d puzzle game that pushes minimalism to its limits. Its beautiful yet challenging puzzles kept me coming back, even when I felt stuck.\u201d<br>4/4 \u2013 David Reviews<br>",
